From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Trey Moen <trey@moen.ai>
Date: Thu, 2 Jul 2026 18:35:41 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] cam: vfe bus: OR per-WM done bits into the subscribe mask

cam_vfe_bus_start_wm assigned its done bit into bus_irq_reg_mask[REG1]
instead of OR-ing, so on ports without a composite group (the FULL port
on vfe170 is Y+UV with no comp group) the Y-done bit was overwritten and
buf_done never fired. OR the bit in.
---
 .../cam_isp/isp_hw_mgr/isp_hw/vfe_hw/vfe_bus/cam_vfe_bus_ver2.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/msm/camera/camera_kt/drivers/cam_isp/isp_hw_mgr/isp_hw/vfe_hw/vfe_bus/cam_vfe_bus_ver2.c b/drivers/media/platform/msm/camera/camera_kt/drivers/cam_isp/isp_hw_mgr/isp_hw/vfe_hw/vfe_bus/cam_vfe_bus_ver2.c
index 71bccfa..ee8e9d3 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/msm/camera/camera_kt/drivers/cam_isp/isp_hw_mgr/isp_hw/vfe_hw/vfe_bus/cam_vfe_bus_ver2.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/msm/camera/camera_kt/drivers/cam_isp/isp_hw_mgr/isp_hw/vfe_hw/vfe_bus/cam_vfe_bus_ver2.c
@@ -1446,7 +1446,7 @@ static int cam_vfe_bus_start_wm(
 		cam_io_w_mb(rsrc_data->stride, (common_data->mem_base +
 			rsrc_data->hw_regs->stride));
 
-	bus_irq_reg_mask[CAM_VFE_BUS_IRQ_REG1] = (1 << rsrc_data->index);
+	bus_irq_reg_mask[CAM_VFE_BUS_IRQ_REG1] |= (1 << rsrc_data->index);
 
 	/* enable ubwc if needed*/
 	if (rsrc_data->en_ubwc) {
